- The site may be quoting the old 2018 ranging bound in other places; the maintainer should search for it.
- The sharp-edged-kernel cell at 10 pc rests on a rough gas estimate. Computing it from a real map of nearby gas clouds would settle the last place a DiskMass fit might still pass.

